    "Overview": "Jock fashion is short to medium-length haircuts that fit easily into helmets and easy to maintain. Accessories are related to sports like sweatbands, wristbands and headbands. Jocks also wear sneakers and letterman jackets, along with sport uniforms. If it's team merchandise, then it's in the colors of the team the jock is showing support for."
